In article <15155810@MVB.SAIC.COM>, khr@hp700.trg.saic.com writes...
>I would like advice that anyone might have to offer on compiling the public
>domain libraries Linpack, Minpack and IEEE signal processing routines on
>an Alpha. Has anyone determined best constants for I1MACH, R1MACH, etc.?
>A related question is: if you use the machine constants set for a VAX VMS
>machine, should you encounter any problems?
> 
