This generaly happens when more then one system offers the service on the
network. 1st system to respond on the request succeeds, the other systems
then fail since the requestor is already receiving info and will not respond
in time to the other systems, so a response timeout error occurs.

(Happens quit a lot when you have a InfoServer offering MOP services for
 terminalservers etc.)

