>shoppa@almach.caltech.edu (TIMOTHY D. SHOPPA) writes:
>>Hello,
>>	We have some old RSX-11M V4.x and RSX-11M+ V2.1 tapes that were written
>>with BRU (the RSX equivalent of BACKUP), and of course we need to read them. We
>>no longer have any PDP's connected to 9-track drives, and it would be much more
