As most people have pointed out, the VMS kernel is written mostly in
MACRO-32.  When I worked on the last incarnation of the LAT driver
(for VAX) we wrote a hybrid of MACRO (for small parts of the driver,
LTDRIVER), C (for the LATACP, a user-level process helper for the
