Whoa! The purpose of the TPC benchmarks is precisely to enable one to make
comparisons of the latter kind. A typical customer rarely gets bids from
vendors such that they can make comparisons of the former kind. E.g., for a
typical bid, you may find Rdb/Alpha competing against Oracle/Sequent or
Sybase/Sun competing against Informix/HP. 

