In article <1993Aug11.085729.4249@ugle.unit.no>, almli@idt.unit.no (Bj|rnar Almli) writes:
> We've been trying to install a 2.4 GB disk from Wave Technologies
> on a uVax 3100.  Everything was OK for three weeks, until now when
> some of the files and about four directories have been ruined, and 
