you need an IP address for the port that the pc will run off.  the address has to be in the same subnet as the address for the server.

after setting up the mask, address, gateway and nameserver you want to do a:

	change port n flow control disabled
	change port n autobaud disabled
	change port n slip enabled
	change port n slip host 69.69.69.69
	change port n dedicated service slip
	change port n dedicated protocol slip
	change port n speed 38400
	change port n break disabled
	change port n stop bits 1

	connect port n


