This is just a quick warning!

We are running DECstation 5000/200's with ULTRIX 4.2A and I used to display 
a logo on the screen when waiting for someone to login. Yeh I hated the DIGITAL logo too.

However I used to find that the machine  would crash about 50% of the
time when the user logged in. This would just throw the user out of
ULTRIX and force them to log in again. It was a real pain in the ass
though.

I eventually went back to displaying the DIGITAL logo and the problem
also went away....

All I'm saying is before playing with a .logo file... BEWARE!!!!!
 

