I work at the Space Telescope Science Institute as a system manager on our
Operational VAXCLUSTER.  It has been down once since March 1989.  That was
due to a fire in a tape drive.  The power went out to the computer room.  In
that time we have upgraded from VMS 5.3 to VMS 5.5 with little down time to
our users.  Most of their down time comes from installing the applications
