If you're distributing your cluster far and wide geographically, bridge and
reouter burps are going to be a problem.  I suggest that you increase the
SYSGEN parameter RECNXINTERVAL to a minimum of 180.  That will help VMS to ride
out the network disruption.  There are other things that you can do with how
VOTES are distributed across the cluster, but increasing RECNXINTERVAL is
usually enough. 

